          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On June 26, 2009, around 11:30 PM, two witnesses observed from their home the passage of a very bright phenomenon that intrigued them. The witness forwarded a photograph taken from a video recorded during the observation. The description of the ascending trajectory from the ground without noise, the duration of the observation, and the brightness suggest a 'real' observation that would have benefited from additional elements. Unfortunately, no additional information was received despite several follow-ups, making any investigation impossible.",
